<title>NORWAY: TABLE - NORWAY'S JULY PPI ROSE 0.4 PCT, UP 2 PCT Y/Y.</title>
<headline>TABLE - NORWAY'S JULY PPI ROSE 0.4 PCT, UP 2 PCT Y/Y.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
